<li class="break-words">Monoidal structure: Sequential composition <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>âŠ—</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\otimes</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord">âŠ—</span></span></span></span>
&nbsp;
