<p dir="auto" class="break-words">## 8. Functional Analysis: Reproducing Kernel Hilbert Spaces</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;
<span>**Connection to Kernel Methods**</span>
&nbsp;
<span>**Definition 8.1 (RKHS for Sequences)**</span>
&nbsp;
