<span>**Connection to Syntactic Composition**</span>
&nbsp;
<span>**Definition 18.1 (Language Operad)**</span>
&nbsp;
An operad <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.08222em;">P</span></span></span></span> consists of:</p>
