<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Human cognition does not compute representations; it </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">generates proxies</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}â€”transient physical patterns (articulatory gestures, saccadic trajectories, sub-vocal oscillations) that stand in for absent worlds.  </span></span>
