<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The RSVP triad is not a metaphor; it is the </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">same differential structure</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">} as the autogenerative statistical manifold.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Every theorem of Part I is now a field equation on the cognitive plenum.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Aspect Relegation is the attractor of the RSVP flow, reached when the transjective endofunctor collapses to its own fixed point.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Part III will derive the full ART Lagrangian from these equations and close the monograph with the universal equilibrium law.</span></span>
