<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Every natural computational systemâ€”biological, linguistic, or cosmologicalâ€”is a **cohesive comprehension object** </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">X</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\in</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{UA}}</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> equipped with an **idempotent comprehension morphism** </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">T_X^</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">2</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">=T_X</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">.  </span></span>
