<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">We quantize the CohFT of Â§</span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\ref</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{sec:cohft} on the derived stack of Â§</span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\ref</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{sec:derivedstack}.</span></span>
