<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">and a functional SchrÃ¶dinger equation for the wave-functional of understanding.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Decoherence is re-interpreted as the collapse of superposed meanings</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">into ergodic sectors of shared comprehension.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
