<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\begin</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">abstract</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">This monograph presents a unified mathematical theory of cognition, language, and cosmology as **autogenerative systems**â€”self-maintaining processes whose internal structure encodes the rules of their own continuation.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Beginning with non-Markovian autoregression and the â€œpregnant present,â€ we ascend through information geometry, operads, sheaves, derived stacks, higher-gauge fields, cohomological field theory, quantum-cohesive extensions, renormalization, and mirror symmetry.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The journey culminates in the **Unified Autogenerative Conjecture**: every natural computational system is a fixed point of the quantum-cohesive renormalization monad, where understanding is the unique state of zero curvature, stationary entropy, and idempotent coherence.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\end</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">abstract</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
