<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">This 200-page monograph presents a complete mathematical theory of cognition, language, and cosmology as **autogenerative systems**.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Every section is fully written: definitions, theorems, proofs, cognitive interpretations, and empirical protocols.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The journey culminates in the **Unified Autogenerative Conjecture** (Â§ 37): every natural computational system is a fixed point of the quantum-cohesive renormalization monad.</span></span>
