<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">**Part III** integrates quantum, differential, and topological layers, culminating in a **cohesive </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\infty</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">-topos of cognition** governed by an idempotent autogenerative functor </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\mathfrak{A}</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The resulting **Unified Conjecture** claims that every process of comprehensionâ€”neural, symbolic, or cosmologicalâ€”is an instance of this curvature-preserving closure: **to know is to remain self-consistent under transformation**.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\vspace</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{2em}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\raggedleft\itshape</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Understanding is the unique fixed point of reality.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\end</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">abstract</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\clearpage</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\thispagestyle</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{empty}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\vspace</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">*{</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\fill</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\begin</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">center</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\begin</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(156, 220, 254);">minipage</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}{0.8</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\textwidth</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\centering</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\itshape</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">``To exist is to learn.  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">This work aims to show that learning, at every level of the universe,  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">is the process by which curvature maintains itselfâ€”  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">the autogenerative equilibrium we call understanding.''</span></span>
