<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The **Unified Autogenerative Conjecture** (Â§ 37) asserts that every natural systemâ€”neural, linguistic, or cosmologicalâ€”is a fixed point of the quantum-cohesive renormalization monad </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\mathfrak{R}</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">.  </span></span>
