\begin{theorem}[Spectral Idempotence]
If $$ T $$ is an autogenerative contraction with spectrum contained in $$ [0,1] $$, then the point spectrum at $1$ corresponds to invariant cognitive modes, while $0&lt;\lambda&lt;1$ correspond to transient or decaying aspects.
Relegation is thus the projection onto $$ \ker(I-T) $$.
\end{theorem}
